<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AFCOL SELLS ROMATEX, IVH STAKES.</title>
<headline>AFCOL SELLS ROMATEX, IVH STAKES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated Furniture Companies Ltd (Afcol) said on Monday it had agreed to dispose of its interests in Island View Holdings Ltd (IVH) and Romatex Ltd to C.G. Smith Ltd for 103.4 million rand in cash.</p>
<p>Afcol holds a 20.6 percent stake in IVH and a 19.3 percent interest in Romatex, Afcol said in a statement.</p>
<p>The disposals would boost Afcol's net cash position significantly, facilitating the expansion of core trading activities.</p>
<p>It said the stakes in Romatex and IVH were not core interests and not strategic to Afcol's furniture and allied manufacturing operations.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
